  "data": {
    "about": "Birth place: Yamagata Prefecture, Japan\n\nBlood type: A\n\nFavorite food: rice with curry\n\nHobbies: bowling, horror films, occult television programs, video games\n\nYoshihiro Togashi is a Japanese manga artist. He is most notable for having created Yuu Yuu Hakusho, for which he received the Shogakukan Manga Award in 1994, and Hunter x Hunter. According to Shonen Jump, Togashi received the Tezuka Award, the most influential new comic artist award in Japan.\n\nTogashi is married to Naoko Takeuchi, the creator of Sailor Moon.\n\nTwitter: @Un4v5s8bgsVk9Xp",
